# What a deploy from this PC (vercel deploy) leaves out: only the website goes up.

# The Android app, its build and its keys
android/
*.jks
*.keystore
*.apk
*.aab

# Settings and secrets (the project's own values are on Vercel)
.env
.env.*
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

# Builds, caches and local tooling (node_modules and .next are left out by the CLI anyway; naming them here also hid
# the installed packages from builds started by GitHub, which then split the site into too many functions)
.next-verify/
out/
/data/
/dist/
.claude/
public/splash-icon/
